{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"23q_wcp_hny_CA","canonical_person_id":"23q_wcp_hny_CA","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["23q_wcp_hny_CA"],"persons":[{"id":"23q_wcp_hny_C","label":"崔景業","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"景業","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008:m0003","c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p009:m0000"]},{"surface":"文季","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008:m0007"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-ws2021236","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008","quote":"景業","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008:m0003"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-ws2021236","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008","quote":"文季","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008:m0007"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-ws2021236","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p009","quote":"景業","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p009:m0000"}],"review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-m0000-p08-m0003-brother"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-m0341-p04-m0033-father"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-ws2021236","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008","quote":"景徽弟景業，字文季。別有功，太和中，賜爵昌國子，加建威將軍。卒。子休緒襲爵，員外郎。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008:m0003","source_term":"景徽弟景業","source_assertion_id":"a-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-m0000-p08-m0003-brother"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-ws2021236","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004","quote":"皇興初，顯祖詔征南大將軍慕容白曜固築長圍以守之。及白曜攻其城東郭，道固面縛請罪，表曰：「臣資生南境，限隔大化，本朝不以卑末，委授藩任。而劉氏蕭牆內侮，懼貽大戮，前遣崔啟之奉表歸誠，幸蒙陛下過垂矜納，并賜爵寵，慶佩罔極，應奔闕庭。但劉彧尋續遣使，恕臣百死。愚以世奉劉氏，深愆蒙宥，若猶違背，則是不忠於本朝，而欲求忠於大魏。雖曰希生，懼大魏之所不許。是用迷回，孤負天日，冒萬死之艱，固執拒守。僕臣白曜，振曜威靈，漸經二載，大將臨城，以今月十四日，臣東郭失守，於臣款彧之誠，庶可以彰於大魏矣。臣勢窮力屈，以十七日面縛請罪，白曜奉宣皇恩，恕臣生命。斯實陛下起臣死尸，肉臣朽骨，天地造物所不能行，而陛下育之。雖虞舜之貸有苗，姬文之宥崇壘，方之聖澤，未足以喻。既未奉朝旨，無由親馳道路，謹遣大息景徽，束骸歸闕，伏聽刑斧。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0341","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0033","source_term":"大息景徽","source_assertion_id":"a-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-m0341-p04-m0033-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"魏書先記道固大息景徽，再記景徽弟景業；依世次暫接。 來源並未逐子重述父名。"}},{"id":"23q_wcp_hny_CA","label":"崔休緒","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"休緒","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008:m0033"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-ws2021236","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008","quote":"休緒","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p008:m0033"}],"review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"23q_wcp_hny_C","source_assertion_id":"a-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu-m0033-p08-m0003-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-024","sourc